{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serene Ponds is a relaxing, free-form pond-building sandbox where creativity flows with no rules, goals, or pressure.\u00a0Sculpt the land, decorate your pond, and watch a thriving frog community grow in harmony with the seasons. Take a deep breath and let nature unfold at your pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc38 Attract Frogs \u2013 Customize your pond to invite new frog species, each drawn to different styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Unique Personalities \u2013 Name your frogs, watch them age, discover color variations, and learn their likes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc9e Breeding &amp; Babies \u2013 Frogs pair up and produce adorable babies that grow into new residents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Shape the Land \u2013 Sculpt and paint terrain to craft ponds, islands, and gentle shorelines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udeb7 Decorate Freely \u2013 Place rocks, lilies, reeds, and other props to make your pond truly yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Lofi Soundscape \u2013 Chill out with a relaxing lofi soundtrack and layered ambient nature sounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f Dynamic World \u2013 Toggle seasons, weather, and time of day to set the perfect mood.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/59a78657ad4bf83aba6ccc870363eaee.poster.avif?t=1759138827\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/59a78657ad4bf83aba6ccc870363eaee.webm?t=1759138827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/59a78657ad4bf83aba6ccc870363eaee.mp4?t=1759138827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpt gentle ponds, shape terrain, and decorate with lilypads, reeds, rocks, and other natural elements. As you build, frogs arrive and your ecosystem slowly grows and responds to your care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no wrong answers, no timers, and no management stress - just the joy of watching your tranquil diorama come to life. Breed frogs, discover new varieties, and enjoy the peaceful rhythm of nature unfolding around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/4b594163d349915b5c7783f0a749c7eb.poster.avif?t=1759138827\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/4b594163d349915b5c7783f0a749c7eb.webm?t=1759138827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/4b594163d349915b5c7783f0a749c7eb.mp4?t=1759138827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience your pond throughout the year with different seasons, time of day, and weather - bringing unique visuals &amp; different ambient sounds to your pond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind in a calm, colourful world filled with soft ambient sounds, playful wildlife, and the freedom to create your perfect serene pond.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924840?t=1759138827","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924840?t=1759138827","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/a1b811f7f1f867e3b71878c39dd3c778e730a505/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759138827","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/a1b811f7f1f867e3b71878c39dd3c778e730a505/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759138827","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serene Ponds is a relaxing, free-form pond-building sandbox where creativity flows with no rules, goals, or pressure.\u00a0Sculpt the land, decorate your pond, and watch a thriving frog community grow in harmony with the seasons. Take a deep breath and let nature unfold at your pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc38 Attract Frogs \u2013 Customize your pond to invite new frog species, each drawn to different styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Unique Personalities \u2013 Name your frogs, watch them age, discover color variations, and learn their likes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc9e Breeding &amp; Babies \u2013 Frogs pair up and produce adorable babies that grow into new residents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Shape the Land \u2013 Sculpt and paint terrain to craft ponds, islands, and gentle shorelines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udeb7 Decorate Freely \u2013 Place rocks, lilies, reeds, and other props to make your pond truly yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Lofi Soundscape \u2013 Chill out with a relaxing lofi soundtrack and layered ambient nature sounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f Dynamic World \u2013 Toggle seasons, weather, and time of day to set the perfect mood.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vid